    "C": "\\(3x^2+2x-1\\)",
    "D": "\\(x^2-4x+1\\)"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(A-B=2x^2-x-(x^2+3x-1)=2x^2-x-x^2-3x+1=x^2-4x+1\\). Note that the sign before the parentheses is negative, so \\(-1\\) must become \\(+1\\).",
